  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protracted Crises Recovery Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Protracted Crises Recovery Assistance (PCRA) investment will provide recovery, rehabilitation, and reconstruction support required for protracted crises and other large-scale disasters. The investment will cover agreements that provide long-term assistance to address the needs of displaced families, households, and communities, especially women and children, persons with disabilities, and older people in vulnerable situations. Activities include protection and social support services, durable housing, policy development, sustainable and climate-resilient livelihoods, and support to displaced families to reduce vulnerabilities to future shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
